{"id":"n16012-2-7","stage":3,"title":"안팎 · 左右","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16012-2-7-1","ko":"저기 있는 저 사람은 몇 살로 보이니?","zh":"那边那个人看起来几岁？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"指代“那个人”。","explanation":"저：指代“那个人”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"2","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람은","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살로","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이니?","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"